# Force LF on shell scripts so they stay executable under Git Bash on the
# Windows CI runners (windows-latest has core.autocrlf=true, which would
# otherwise CRLF-convert them on checkout -> `\r: command not found`). The
# cross-version Windows behavioral legs (41n-quater-sexies) invoke
# scripts/test_framework/run_units_cold.sh for the 4.2 class-cache warm-up,
# including when this repo is checked out as a sibling of the server repo.
*.sh text eol=lf
